#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A price at 0 combined with the setting \"Hide Add To Cart\" prevents "
"bookings from your website!"
msgstr "价格为 0 再加上“隐藏加入购物车”设置，会阻止客户从您的网站下单！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "A true gem in the middle of Belgium.&amp;nbsp;"
msgstr "比利时中部的一颗真正的明珠。&nbsp;"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "A true haven of peace."
msgstr "真正的宁静避风港。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"A whimsical escape crafted with our younger guests in mind. Featuring an "
"exciting elevated loft bed, the Kids Corner transforms bedtime into a fun, "
"cozy hideaway they’ll actually look forward to."
msgstr ""
"一处专为小客人们打造的奇趣天地。儿童角配备好玩的抬高阁楼床，把睡觉时间变成他"
"们真心期待的舒适有趣的小天地。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_19
msgid ""
"A whimsical escape with an elevated loft bed, crafted with younger guests in "
"mind."
msgstr "一处带抬高阁楼床的奇趣天地，专为小客人们打造。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "A&amp;nbsp; message from your host"
msgstr "来自主人的&nbsp;一封信"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:website.page,name:guest_house.page_about_us
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the rates from the same menu to see how price rules apply during the "
"year."
msgstr "通过同一菜单访问费率，查看全年价格规则的适用情况。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Access to more details clicking the slot."
msgstr "点击时段即可查看更多详情。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add a line with Dinner Plate and update the counts as per guest request."
msgstr "加入数据行“晚餐”，并按客人要求更新人数。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add here as many of them as needed."
msgstr "可在此处，按需要增加数量。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust the number of stars, leave a comment and send it!"
msgstr "选择评分星星数目，输入留言，然后传送。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Adjust the rental dates, click the book button and then proceed to checkout."
msgstr "设定租赁日期，点击预订按钮，然后前往结账。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust your prices along the year"
msgstr "全年灵活调整价格"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjusting your offers in consequence"
msgstr "相应调整您的住宿产品"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Again, the <strong>Guest House App </strong>helps you manage the end of the "
"stay!"
msgstr "同样，<strong>宾馆应用程序</strong>可协助您管理住宿完结时的退房工作！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to individual resource blocking slots described earlier, you "
"can select a resource this leave applies to."
msgstr "除了前面介绍的单个资源锁定时段外，您也可以选择此假期所适用的资源。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, and then change the resource.<br/"
">Be\n"
"                    careful not to double book a resource with such change!"
msgstr ""
"或者，您可切换至列表检视画面，然后更改资源。<br/>\n"
"                    修改时记得要小心，不要重复预订同一项资源！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, which is more suitable if the "
"booking is\n"
"                    not during the visualized date range and update the "
"booking date range."
msgstr ""
"或者，您可切换至列表检视画面（若相关预订\n"
"                    不在视觉化显示的日期范围内，列表检视模式会更适合）。然"
"后，更新预订日期范围。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type in the search bar and select the appropriate filter."
msgstr "或者，在搜寻列中输入字词，并选择适当的筛选器。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can create a slot as placeholder from the planning "
"directly:"
msgstr "或者，您也可以直接从计划视图中创建占位时段："

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "An address must be specified for a map to be embedded"
msgstr "必须为要嵌入的地图指定地址"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Any question?"
msgstr "有任何疑问？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Anyone can create a portal account on your database.<br/>Open your website "
"home page\n"
"                in a private tab to do so."
msgstr ""
"任何人都可在您的数据库上，建立门户网站帐户。<br/>\n"
"                以私隐模式分页开启您网站的主页，即可建立帐户。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign them a resource, which helps you keeping track."
msgstr "为它们分配资源，便于您跟踪。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time during their stay, open their rental order from the Guest House "
"App."
msgstr "宾客住宿期间，任何时候您都可在宾馆应用程序中，开启他们的租赁订单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time from the guest order, use the Send message capability in the "
"chatter\n"
"                    to exchange with your guest."
msgstr ""
"任何时候，都可使用宾客订单的聊天栏，利用发送讯息功能\n"
"                    与客人沟通。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time you can adjust the city tax count delivered by re-opening the "
"city tax widget clicking the City Tax button on the guest order."
msgstr ""
"您随时可以通过点击客人订单上的“城市税”按钮重新打开城市税小工具，来调整已计入"
"的城市税数量。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "At the end of their stay, they'll be able to pay for all those extras."
msgstr "宾客住宿完结时，将有机会为所有额外项目付款。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Because keeping an eye on your business performance matter, the module comes "
"with a dedicated dashboard."
msgstr "由于关注业务表现至关重要，本模块自带专属仪表板。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Beyond daily operations, the Steering menu serves as the \"Captain’s "
"Bridge\" of your guest house. It provides a 500-day horizon to anticipate "
"market trends, manage risks, and optimize your revenue."
msgstr ""
"除日常运营外，“驾驶舱”菜单就是您民宿的“船长驾驶台”。它提供 500 天的时间视野，"
"帮助您预判市场趋势、管理风险并优化收入。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Blocking resources"
msgstr "锁定资源"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Booking a room"
msgstr "预定房间"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:product.template,name:guest_house.product_template_12
msgid "Breakfast (1 guest)"
msgstr "早餐（1 位客人）"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Bright, airy and full of natural light, from sun-drenched mornings to "
"soothing evenings."
msgstr "明亮通透、自然采光充足，从阳光满室的清晨到舒缓安宁的夜晚。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Odoo 会根据您所在的位置将税项和应税设定引入您的数据库。这些已预先"
"配置好，方便您向境外销售；但如果您需要对外国客户也适用本地税率，则可能需要做"
"少量配置。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products,\n"
"            sale orders and more."
msgstr ""
"上载此模块的模拟数据后，您的数据库已填入一些产品记录、\n"
"            销售单等数据。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "向客户收取相应金额，就大功告成了！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "向客人收费"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guests who stayed in each room. "
"Then confirm the number of city taxes to be charged, which updates the "
"delivered city tax count."
msgstr ""
"核对并在需要时调整每个房间入住的客人数。然后确认应收取的城市税数量，系统会相"
"应更新已计入的城市税数量。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "办理客人入住"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "办理客人退房"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check information and then confirm the booking."
msgstr "核对信息并确认预订。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "核对发票资料，然后确认。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Check-in is from 3:00 PM and check-out is until 11:00 AM. Early or late "
"arrangements can often be made on request."
msgstr ""
"入住时间为下午 3:00 起，退房时间至上午 11:00。如有需要，通常可提前或延迟安"
"排。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"城市税在实践中按实际入住的夜晚数计收，而非按理论人数，计算方式为每位客人入住"
"晚数之和。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the room to book."
msgstr "点击其中一个房间，以进行预订。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr "点击“入住”按钮确认客人现已入住！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "点击“退房”按钮记录客人归还钥匙。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "点击“创建订单”打开订单表单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Invoice button with a full invoice."
msgstr "点击发票按钮，以查看完整发票。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Pay with demo button, and then Pay button to mimic the payment."
msgstr "点击“演示支付”按钮，然后点击“支付”按钮模拟支付过程。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the tail of the corresponding booking and drag it to the requested "
"date."
msgstr "点击相应预订的尾部并将其拖拽到要求的日期。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:website.page,name:guest_house.page_contactus
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.header_call_to_action
msgid "Contact Us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_16
msgid "Cozy warmth and intimate charm around a crackling fire."
msgstr "围坐噼啪作响的炉火旁，尽享温馨暖意与私密情调。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave selecting the appropriate working schedule, the one from "
"your stay resources."
msgstr "新建休假单据，请选用住宿资源项下对应的适用排班方案。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave the same way as previously, but this time specify the "
"resource this applies to."
msgstr "按之前的方式新建假期，但这次要指定它适用的资源。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Created offers are assigned no company nor branch (default behavior).<br/>As "
"a result, they are available from all companies and branches, as well as all "
"websites from those."
msgstr ""
"创建的报价单不会被分配到任何公司或分支机构（默认行为）。<br/>因此，所有公司和"
"分支机构以及其所属的所有网站均可访问这些报价单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Cyclists can follow the Bay Trail south from downtown and connect through "
"Geneva Avenue. Head toward Executive Park Blvd, where bike racks are "
"available at 250 Executive Park Blvd, Suite 3400."
msgstr ""
"骑行者可从市中心沿海湾小径向南骑行，经由日内瓦大道通行。前往行政公园大道方"
"向，250 号行政公园大道 3400 室设有自行车停放架。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Define start and end date time and save your leave."
msgstr "定义开始与结束的日期时间并保存您的假期。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Deliver extra services"
msgstr "提供额外服务"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Describe your request"
msgstr "请描述您的需求"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.template_footer_descriptive
msgid "Designed for disconnexion"
msgstr "为断开连接而设计"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "Different atmospheres for you to find the one you need"
msgstr "多种氛围，总有一款适合您"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:product.template,name:guest_house.product_template_20
msgid "Dinner Plate (1 guest)"
msgstr "餐盘（1 位客人）"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Disconnection?&amp;nbsp;Yes but no compromise with comfort."
msgstr "想断开连接？&nbsp;可以，但舒适绝不打折扣。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "发掘有关 Odoo 的更多信息，请了解我们的"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Discover our highlights"
msgstr "探索我们的亮点"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to\n"
"            improve your experience."
msgstr "了解此套餐的基础知识，探索 Odoo 为提升您体验所提供的所有可能性。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to replicate the Booking Blocker rule on all your pricelists "
"and to specify the website this applies to.<br/>On a regular basis postpone "
"this booking blocker start date season after season to unlock your calendar."
msgstr ""
"别忘了在所有价格表上复制该预订拦截规则，并指定其适用的网站。<br/>请定期逐季推"
"迟该预订拦截的开始日期，以解锁您的日历。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
