#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr "打开默认价格表，查看其中现有的价格规则。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Guest House App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "打开民宿应用，导航到“配置 / 假期”菜单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Guest House App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "打开民宿应用，然后从菜单导航到订单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Guest House App to appreciate the currently planned bookings with "
"the\n"
"                Schedule."
msgstr "打开民宿应用，通过日程查看当前已计划的预订。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"从住宿应用的“客房清洁”菜单打开计划。<br/>\n"
"                您可以在那里为客房清洁工作创建班次并指派员工。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Guest House App</strong>, "
"Configuration / Pricelists menu."
msgstr "从<strong>民宿应用</strong>的“配置 / 价格表”菜单打开价格表。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "打开驾驶舱菜单并选择“可用性”。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "打开驾驶舱菜单并选择“入住率”。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
msgstr "打开调查应用，找到客户满意度调查。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Taxes from the <strong>Invoicing App</strong>, under the "
"Configuration / Accounting menu."
msgstr "从<strong>发票应用</strong>的“配置 / 会计”菜单下打开税项。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio\n"
"                App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"借助<strong>Studio\n"
"                应用</strong>的强大能力，开启更多自定义工作流和操作。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the guest order."
msgstr "打开客人订单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the order of you just arrived guests."
msgstr "打开刚刚抵达的客人的订单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open your guest order from the Guest House App."
msgstr "从民宿应用打开您的客人订单。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Our guest house is not just a place to stay; it's a place to create lasting "
"memories, filled with comfort and genuine hospitality. Each moment spent "
"here is crafted to make you feel at home."
msgstr ""
"我们的民宿不只是一个落脚之处，更是一个创造持久回忆的地方，充满舒适与真诚的好"
"客之情。在这里度过的每一刻，都为了让您感到宾至如归。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "Our rooms"
msgstr "我们的房间"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Paragliding"
msgstr "滑翔伞"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_20
msgid "Perfect for a relaxed evening at the property."
msgstr "非常适合在民宿度过一个轻松的夜晚。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Plan, check in and and check out bookings with the <strong>Guest House App</"
"strong>"
msgstr "使用<strong>民宿应用</strong>规划、办理入住和退房"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Prevent bookings year in advance"
msgstr "防止提前一年被预订"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Previous slide"
msgstr "上一张幻灯片"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Promote your offers through the <strong>Website App</strong>"
msgstr "通过<strong>网站制作应用程序</strong>推广您的优惠活动"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "联系我们"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Record guest identity"
msgstr "记录客人身份"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Recording the guest attendance is an obligation in numerous countries."
msgstr "在许多国家，登记客人入住信息是法定义务。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Save the order with those extra services"
msgstr "保存包含这些额外服务的订单"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.option_footer_scrolltop
msgid "Scroll To Top"
msgstr "滚动到顶部"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "Scroll down to next section"
msgstr "向下滚动到下一节"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "See All"
msgstr "查看全部"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "See all<span class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right ms-2\"/>"
msgstr "查看全部 <span class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right ms-2\"/>"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"See that for demo purpose we setup typical uplift and discount rules to "
"adjust your prices during key periods."
msgstr ""
"可以看到，出于演示目的，我们设置了典型的加价和折扣规则，用于在关键时期调整价"
"格。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "See that it contains a rule booking blocker setting price to 0."
msgstr "可以看到其中包含一条预订拦截规则，将价格设为 0。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select one of your employee."
msgstr "选择您的一名员工。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Select or create a customer and then confirm the booking!"
msgstr "选择或创建客户，然后确认预订！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Selling local products? Use the <strong>Point of Sales App </strong>for easy "
"sales."
msgstr "销售本地产品？使用<strong>POS 应用</strong>轻松完成销售。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Send Message"
msgstr "发送信息"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Setup company or branch specific offers when relevant."
msgstr "在需要时设置针对公司或分支机构的专属住宿产品。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share your stay offers across your companies and branches (default behavior);"
msgstr "在您的各公司和分支机构之间共享住宿产品（默认行为）；"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Simply open the Dashboard App to land on the Performance dashboard."
msgstr "只需打开仪表板应用，即可进入绩效仪表板。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Sink into pure comfort in our Fireplace room. Radiating soft light and "
"soothing warmth, this room offers a romantic, serene atmosphere that invites "
"you to curl up, slow down, and truly unwind."
msgstr ""
"在壁炉客房中沉浸于纯粹的舒适。柔和的光线与抚慰人心的暖意，为这间客房营造出浪"
"漫而宁静的氛围，邀请您蜷起身子、放慢脚步，真正放松下来。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Skydiving"
msgstr "跳伞"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:guest_house.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Step into a haven of self-care. The highlight of the Bubbles room is its "
"stunning, deep copper bathtub; the ultimate centerpiece for soaking away the "
"day’s adventures with a glass of wine in hand."
msgstr ""
"步入一处自我呵护的港湾。泡泡客房的最大亮点是其惊艳的深铜浴缸——手持一杯葡萄"
"酒，泡去一天探险的疲惫，堪称极致享受。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Still from the Guest House App Schedule, simply drag and drop a booking to "
"another\n"
"                more comfortable room!"
msgstr ""
"仍在旅馆管理应用的日程表界面，只需拖拽预订记录，\n"
"                即可将客人调整至更舒适的房间！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Still from their Rental Order, open the Guests tab."
msgstr "在该租赁订单页面，打开宾客标签页。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Surrounding Gabi Guesthouse are 45 unique activities waiting to be "
"discovered. From tranquil forest strolls, local tasting tours, and peaceful "
"garden retreats to energizing bike paths, mountain trails, and outdoor "
"sports, you can design every day to match your mood."
msgstr ""
"Gabi 民宿周边有 45 项独具特色的活动等待您去发现。从宁静的森林漫步、本地美食品"
"鉴之旅、清幽的花园休憩，到充满活力的自行车道、山地步道和户外运动，您可以让每"
"一天都契合自己的心情。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Take BART to Balboa Park Station. From there, board the 29 bus toward "
"Bayview and get off at Executive Park. The building at 250 Executive Park "
"Blvd, Suite 3400, is just a short walk from the stop."
msgstr ""
"乘坐 BART 至巴尔博亚公园站（Balboa Park Station）。从那里搭乘开往湾景"
"（Bayview）方向的 29 路公交，在行政公园（Executive Park）下车。行政公园大道 "
"250 号 3400 室距车站仅几步之遥。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the availability for you to "
"work on filling in."
msgstr "甘特图以不同颜色标示可用性，方便您着手填满空档。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the occupancy, the higher the "
"better."
msgstr "甘特图以不同颜色标示入住率，越高越好。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "The King's path"
msgstr "国王之路"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Occupancy view allows you to visualize your \"Sales Success\". It "
"answers one simple question: <i>How well am I filling my guest house?</i>"
msgstr ""
"入住率视图让您直观看到“销售成果”。它回答一个简单的问题：<i>我的民宿住得有多"
"满？</i>"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The strength of Odoo is to separate the accounting and many other aspects "
"which are company dependent!"
msgstr "Odoo 的强大之处在于将会计以及许多依赖公司的方面分离处理！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The tasks are assigned to balance cleaning points from the stay offers "
"within employees assigned to the associated house keeping role."
msgstr ""
"任务会根据住宿产品中的清洁点进行平衡分配，分派给承担相应客房清洁角色的员工。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then empty the fiscal position so that the tax applies regardless of your "
"customer's fiscal position."
msgstr "然后清空应税设定，使该税项无论客户的应税设定如何都会适用。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr "这些都是您当前订阅中的免费内容；请随意浏览！🙃"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"They as well share the same pricing, defined at the stay offer level, which "
"has its pros and cons."
msgstr "二者均采用住宿套餐维度统一设定的价格，这种模式有利也有弊。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They want multiple rooms?"
msgstr "他们想要多个房间？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They were happy about their stay, let's ask them to leave a review."
msgstr "客人若对住宿体验十分满意，可邀请他们留下评价。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This blocks simulataneously all resources related to this working schedule "
"during the prescribed period."
msgstr "该操作会在指定时段内，同时锁定此排班对应的全部资源。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "This capability is enabled by a setting you can set/unset."
msgstr "此功能通过一个可开启/关闭的设置来启用。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This configuration step may be required to avoid any tax collection "
"inconsistency."
msgstr "为避免任何税款征收不一致，可能需要执行此配置步骤。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup can be used for all products that must keep local tax rates (e.g. "
"late check-in)."
msgstr "此设置可用于所有必须保持本地税率的产品（例如延迟入住）。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup is relevant in case of place specific offers or when pricing "
"varies between places."
msgstr "该配置适用于场地专属套餐，或不同场地执行差异化定价的场景。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time click the Add to last order button to add this room to the booking "
"and\n"
"                voila!"
msgstr "这次点击“添加到上一个订单”按钮，将此房间加入预订，就完成了！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time, simply leave a note about the why this is booked and save the "
"slot."
msgstr "这次只需留下说明，注明预订原因，然后保存时段。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "To benefit from this capability, activate the corresponding setting."
msgstr "要享受此功能，请启用相应设置。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Trace guest attendance"
msgstr "记录客人入住"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"True to its name, Lumos is designed to feel bright, airy, and full of "
"positive energy. Sun-drenched by day and soothing by night, it’s the perfect "
"space to awaken feeling fully refreshed and inspired."
msgstr ""
"卢莫斯客房名副其实，明亮通透，充满正能量。白天阳光满室，夜晚宁静安神，是让您"
"醒来时神清气爽、灵感涌现的理想空间。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Two options are now available to you with multiple companies and branches:"
msgstr "使用多公司和分支机构时，您现在有两种选择："

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Type in the customer name in the Schedule search bar filtering by Customer."
msgstr "在时间表的搜寻列，输入客户名称，并选择依据客户筛选。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Type your message here..."
msgstr "在此输入您的信息……"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "We are committed to delivering hight experience."
msgstr "我们致力于提供高品质体验。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We offer a warm, personal touch you won't find in big hotels; comfortable "
"rooms, homemade breakfasts, and hosts who genuinely care about your stay."
msgstr ""
"我们提供大型酒店所没有的温暖与贴心：舒适的客房、自制的早餐，以及真正关心您入"
"住体验的主人。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We welcome well-behaved pets in select rooms;&amp;nbsp;just let us know in "
"advance so we can prepare accordingly."
msgstr ""
"部分客房欢迎行为良好的宠物入住；&nbsp;请提前告知我们，以便我们做好准备。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We're just a short walk from the town center, close to local restaurants, "
"shops, and public transport."
msgstr "我们距离镇中心仅几步之遥，邻近当地餐厅、商店和公共交通。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Welcome to <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_jagged\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: "
"3px;\">Gabi</span> Guesthouse"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到 <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_jagged\" style=\"--"
"text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: 3px;\">Gabi</"
"span> 民宿"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Welcome your guests as well from the <strong>Guest House App</strong>."
msgstr "您也可以通过<strong>民宿应用</strong>迎接客人。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We’re thrilled to have you here. Nestled in a peaceful setting, Gabi "
"Guesthouse offers cozy rooms, friendly service, and a relaxed atmosphere to "
"help you recharge.<br/><br/>Whether you're visiting for leisure or work, "
"we’re dedicated to making your stay as comfortable and memorable as "
"possible. Ready to relax? Explore our rooms and reserve your stay today!<br/"
"><br/>Which vibe fits your guesthouse best (e.g., cozy/rustic, modern/"
"boutique, budget-friendly), or is there a specific location/amenity you'd "
"like to highlight?"
msgstr ""
"很高兴您来到这里。Gabi 民宿坐落于宁静的环境中，提供舒适的客房、友善的服务和轻"
"松的氛围，助您恢复元气。<br/><br/>无论您是休闲还是出差，我们都致力于让您的入"
"住尽可能舒适难忘。准备放松了吗？马上浏览我们的客房并预订您的住宿！<br/><br/>"
"哪种氛围最适合您的民宿（例如温馨/乡村风、现代/精品风、经济实惠），或者有想要"
"特别突出的位置/设施吗？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Whatever your speed, return each evening to the tranquil comfort of your "
"guesthouse sanctuary."
msgstr "无论您的节奏快慢，每晚都能回到民宿这处宁静舒适的避风港。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When creating an offer, assign them a company or a branch.<br/>As a result, "
"they are available only for the selected company or branch, and will be "
"available only from its website."
msgstr ""
"创建住宿产品时，为其指定公司或分支机构。<br/>这样它们仅对所选公司或分支机构可"
"用，并且只能从该公司的网站访问。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.website_sale_product_oe_structure_website_sale_product_2
msgid ""
"Whether you're into culture, scenic hikes, relaxing retreats, or local "
"crafts, you'll find plenty to do around the guesthouse. Please be sure to "
"book your activities in advance, or feel free to ask our team to help you "
"plan your itinerary!"
msgstr ""
"无论您偏爱文化体验、风景徒步、放松休养还是本地手工艺，民宿周边都有丰富的选"
"择。请务必提前预订活动，或随时让我们的团队帮您规划行程！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While Occupancy focuses on what is full, the Availability view focuses on "
"what is left to sell. It is your primary tool for operational safety and "
"\"Scarcity Pricing.\""
msgstr ""
"入住率关注的是已经住满的部分，而可用性视图关注的是还剩多少可售。它是您保障运"
"营安全和实施“稀缺定价”的首要工具。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Willing to upgrade a booking?"
msgstr "是否愿意升级预订？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"With over 45 activities around us, picking the right ones can feel tricky! "
"Here are the 5 guest-favorite experiences you simply can’t go wrong with."
msgstr ""
"周边有 45 项以上活动，挑选起来可能让人犯难！以下是 5 项最受客人喜爱的体验，选"
"择它们绝不会出错。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the create slot for this resource, no overlapping booking slot would be "
"created.<br/>Care about the start and end time or this blockage to make to "
"re-open when suited."
msgstr ""
"为该资源创建时段后，不会产生重叠的预订时段。<br/>请注意这个锁定的开始和结束时"
"间，以便在合适的时候重新开放。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "想与我们讨论您的 Odoo 设置或更进一步吗？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Yes, a freshly prepared breakfast is included every morning, made with local "
"and seasonal ingredients whenever possible."
msgstr "是的，每天早上都包含新鲜现做的早餐，尽可能使用本地和当季食材。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Yes, both free parking and high-speed Wi-Fi are available throughout your "
"stay at no extra cost."
msgstr "是的，入住期间免费提供停车位和高速 Wi-Fi，不额外收费。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You are repairing a room or simply welcoming family and don't want guests to "
"book it?<br/>Alternatively, you are closing for a week during an inter "
"season break?<br/>Let's have this reflected in your schedule!"
msgstr ""
"您正在维修房间，或者只是接待家人，不希望客人预订？<br/>又或者您要在淡季歇业一"
"周？<br/>让我们把这种情况反映到日程中！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "您可以在主仪表板上访问 Odoo 数据库中每个已安装的应用程序。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can as well select your company and in the Branches tab define branches."
msgstr "您也可以选择您的公司，并在“分支机构”选项卡中定义分支机构。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can create an alternative customer satisfaction survey and select it "
"from the Automated Survey settings, as well as configure the email delay as "
"you wish the email to be sent after the guest checkout."
msgstr ""
"您可以创建一个替代的客户满意度调查，并在自动调查设置中选择它，还可以按您希望"
"在客人退房后发送邮件的时间来配置邮件延迟。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your\n"
"                    Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"您已完成了该演示用例！还有无数种方法可以调整你的 Odoo 设置，以满足您的业务需"
"求。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You could customize this section to add the identity document picture or "
"extra\n"
"                    fields at your convenience with studio. Just be careful, "
"such customizations can\n"
"                    quickly become messy."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 Studio 自定义此部分，按需添加身份证件照片或额外字段。只是要小心，"
"这类自定义很快就会变得杂乱。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt;\n"
"                    Upgrade your package and check the related box"
msgstr ""
"您还没有导入演示数据？仍然可以导入。前往应用 &gt; 行业 &gt;\n"
"                    升级您的行业包并勾选相应选项"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You guest house is online and future guests found it!"
msgstr "您的民宿已上线，未来的客人已经找到了它！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You have a future guest on the line willing to book a room?"
msgstr "有位未来客人正在咨询，想要预订房间？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for Guest House package. By doing so, we have "
"installed a\n"
"            bunch of necessary apps to run your business efficiently."
msgstr ""
"您刚刚安装了 Odoo 民宿行业包。为此，我们已安装了一系列必要的应用，助您高效经"
"营业务。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may be running multiple places at the same time and most likely be "
"willing to run them all from the same database.<b/>We got you covered with "
"this using multiple companies or branches!"
msgstr ""
"您可能同时在经营多个场所，并且很可能希望全部在同一个数据库中管理。<b/>使用多"
"公司或分支机构功能即可满足这一需求！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may want to uplift your margin during high season and be attractive "
"during low one playing on price.<br/>To do so, let's define price rules."
msgstr ""
"您可能希望在旺季提高利润率，又在淡季以价格吸引客人。<br/>为此，我们来定义价格"
"规则。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You might have tested this package with or without demo data."
msgstr "您可能已经在有或没有演示数据的情况下测试过本行业包。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You noticed that the Identity Check highlights whether you captured all the\n"
"            necessary information for a guest?"
msgstr "您是否注意到“身份核查”会高亮显示您是否已采集客人的全部必要信息？"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You now know how to create a new order.<br/>Let's replicate the previous "
"steps but\n"
"                this time, without confirming the order (just saving it as "
"draft)."
msgstr ""
"现在您已经知道如何创建新订单。<br/>我们来重复之前的步骤，但\n"
"                这次不确认订单（仅保存为草稿）。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows\n"
"            you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"您可以执行以下流程，快速了解使用 Odoo 与本行业包可以运行的各项业务流程。"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You welcome your first guests, awesome!"
msgstr "您迎来了第一批客人，太棒了！"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You're now waiting for your guest to arrive."
msgstr "现在您正等待客人抵达。"

